WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.835
            Cersei:             
 <i>MYRCELLA IS MY ONLY DAUGHTER.</i>  

2
00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.354
DO YOU REALLY THINK I'LL LET YOU
 SELL HER LIKE A COMMON WHORE?  

3
00:00:05.388 --> 00:00:07.339
        DORNE IS THE SAFEST     
        PLACE FOR HER.          

4
00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:10.175
     - YOU CANNOT STOP IT.      
     - NO!                      

5
00:00:11.861 --> 00:00:13.629
            ( groans )          

6
00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:18.083
            NO. WAIT.           
            IT WASN'T HER.      

7
00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.135
          ( grunts )            

8
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:24.039
     - ( wailing )              
     - YOU CAN'T AVENGE HIM     
       IF YOU'RE DEAD.          

9
00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:27.526
ON BEHALF OF THE WARLOCKS       
OF QARTH. I WELCOME YOU.        

10
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.294
        ( crowd gasps )         

11
00:00:29.312 --> 00:00:32.181
     IT WOULD BE AN HONOR       
TO HOST YOU AT THE HOUSE        
        OF THE UNDYING.         

12
00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:34.349
      MOTHER OF DRAGONS.        

13
00:00:34.384 --> 00:00:36.535
   Littlefinger:                
   <i>STANNIS WILL BE HERE</i>         
   <i>IN AN HOUR.</i>                  

14
00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.336
  RENLY'S BANNERMEN             
  WILL FLOCK TO HIM.            

15
00:00:38.354 --> 00:00:40.239
        CALLING YOURSELF KING   
        DOESN'T MAKE YOU ONE.   

16
00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.974
     AND IF RENLY WASN'T A KING.
     I WASN'T A QUEEN.          

17
00:00:42.992 --> 00:00:46.278
  - DO YOU WANT TO BE A QUEEN?  
  - I WANT TO BE <i>THE</i> QUEEN.     

18
00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.946
     THERE ON THAT MOUNTAIN.    

19
00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.532
WE NEED TO GET RID              
OF THOSE LOOKOUTS.              

20
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.768
I NEED TO MOVE FAST             
AND SILENT.                     

21
00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:55.120
LORD COMMANDER.                 
I'D LIKE TO JOIN                
LORD QHORIN.                    

22
00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.388
             AYE.               

23
00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.873
ARE YOU GOING                   
TO KILL JOFFREY?                

24
00:00:57.907 --> 00:00:59.992
      - IF THE GODS             
        GIVE ME STRENGTH.       
      - AND THEN WHAT?          

25
00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:01.844
            FIRST WE HAVE TO    
            WIN THE WAR.        

26
00:01:01.878 --> 00:01:03.695
            YOU NEVER TOLD ME   
            WHERE YOU'RE FROM.  

27
00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.247
 <i>VOLANTIS.</i>                      

28
00:01:05.281 --> 00:01:07.466
YOU'RE ONE OF THEM NOW.         
I SHOULD HAVE LET YOU BURN.     

29
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.501
         YOU SAVED ME           
    AND THE TWO I WAS WITH.     

30
00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.353
YOU STOLE THREE DEATHS          
FROM THE RED GOD.               

31
00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.572
     - SPEAK THREE NAMES.       
     - I CAN NAME ANYONE?       

32
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:15.824
     - <i>AND YOU'LL KILL HIM?</i>     
     - A MAN HAS SAID.          

33
00:01:15.859 --> 00:01:18.360
             Arya:              
 <i>THE ONE WHO TORTURES EVERYONE.</i> 
   <i>THEY CALL HIM THE TICKLER.</i>   

34
00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:22.448
Theon:                          
THE STONY SHORE'S NOT FAR       
FROM TORRHEN'S SQUARE.          

35
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.967
    MORE IMPRESSIVE PRIZE THAN  
    A FEW FISHERMAN'S DAUGHTERS.

36
00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:27.385
SOON AS WINTERFELL              
GOT WORD THAT WE'D TAKEN        
TORRHEN'S SQUARE.               

37
00:01:27.403 --> 00:01:29.755
THE STARKS WOULD SEND           
THEIR MEN TO TAKE IT BACK.      

38
00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.740
TAKE ME TO MY SHIP.             

39
00:01:31.775 --> 00:01:34.443
    LORD STARK. TORRHEN'S SQUARE
    IS UNDER SIEGE.             

40
00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.795
      TORRHEN'S SQUARE IS BARELY
      40 LEAGUES FROM HERE.     

41
00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.630
     GO. SER RODRIK.            
     TAKE THE MEN YOU NEED.     

42
00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:40.149
 Osha:                          
 <i>WHAT DID YOU SEE</i>               
 <i>IN YOUR DREAM?</i>                 

43
00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:41.633
        THAT THE SEA CAME       
        TO WINTERFELL.          

44
00:01:41.651 --> 00:01:43.469
           <i>DROWNED MEN WERE</i>     
           <i>FLOATING IN THE YARD.</i>

45
00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:51.927
            SER RODRIK          
            WAS ONE OF THEM.    

46
00:01:51.961 --> 00:01:54.496
 <i>( theme music playing )</i>        

47
00:03:38.902 --> 00:03:41.103
    - <i>( people shouting )</i>       
     - <i>( swords clanging )</i>      

48
00:03:43.273 --> 00:03:46.658
      - <i>( dogs barking )</i>        
      - <i>( ravens cawing )</i>       

49
00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:53.064
         - <i>( banging )</i>          
         - ( gasps )            

50
00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:58.453
        ( caws )                

51
00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:23.145
        I'VE TAKEN YOUR CASTLE. 

52
00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:25.897
    - THEON?                    
    - IT'S PRINCE THEON NOW.    

53
00:04:25.931 --> 00:04:28.450
        GET UP.                 
        YOU HAVE TO GET DRESSED.

54
00:04:28.484 --> 00:04:30.869
        I'VE TAKEN WINTERFELL.  

55
00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.905
            I TOOK IT.          
            I'M OCCUPYING IT.   

56
00:04:33.939 --> 00:04:37.042
I SENT MEN OVER THE WALLS       
WITH GRAPPLING CLAWS AND ROPES. 

57
00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:40.162
     - WHY?                     
     - TO TAKE THE CASTLE.      

58
00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:44.616
 - YOU WENT WITH ROBB.          
 - AND HE SENT ME BACK TO PYKE. 

59
00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:48.286
I'M A GREYJOY.                  
I CAN'T FIGHT FOR ROBB          
AND MY FATHER BOTH.             

60
00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:52.341
    - WHERE'S HODOR?            
        - I DON'T KNOW.         

61
00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:54.760
 FIND THE HALFWIT.              

62
00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.729
MY MEN ARE BRINGING YOUR PEOPLE 
  TOGETHER IN THE COURTYARD.    

63
00:04:57.764 --> 00:04:59.181
        WHY?                    

64
00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:01.183
          SO YOU AND I CAN      
          GO DOWN AND TELL THEM 

65
00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:04.102
      - HOW YOU'VE YIELDED      
        WINTERFELL TO ME.       
      - I WON'T.                

66
00:05:04.136 --> 00:05:06.188
              YES. YOU WILL.    

67
00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:09.307
  I WON'T.                      
  I'LL NEVER YIELD.             

68
00:05:09.325 --> 00:05:11.410
  WE'LL FIGHT YOU               
  AND THROW YOU OUT.            

69
00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:13.578
                 ( sighs )      

70
00:05:17.367 --> 00:05:18.817
         THE CASTLE IS MINE.    

71
00:05:18.835 --> 00:05:21.286
             BUT THESE PEOPLE   
             ARE STILL YOURS.   

72
00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.488
             YOU'LL YIELD       
             TO KEEP THEM SAFE. 

73
00:05:23.506 --> 00:05:25.990
            TO KEEP THEM ALIVE. 

74
00:05:26.009 --> 00:05:28.827
            THAT'S WHAT A GOOD  
            LORD WOULD DO.      

75
00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:34.466
          THINK CAREFULLY ABOUT 
          WHAT YOU WANT TO SAY. 

76
00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:39.554
 THEON.                         

77
00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:41.556
    DID YOU HATE US             
    THE WHOLE TIME?             

78
00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:49.364
     - <i>( thunder rumbles )</i>      
     - ( horse whinnies )       

79
00:05:49.399 --> 00:05:51.516
    I'VE YIELDED                
    WINTERFELL TO THEON.        

80
00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:53.485
 LOUDER.                        

81
00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:55.320
 SAY PRINCE THEON.              

82
00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:58.373
        I'VE YIELDED WINTERFELL 
        TO PRINCE THEON.        

83
00:05:58.408 --> 00:06:00.125
    YOU ALL KNOW ME.            

84
00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:02.961
    AYE. WE KNOW YOU FOR        
    A STEAMING SACK OF SHIT.    

85
00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:04.663
FARLEN. YOU BE SILENT.          

86
00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:07.799
     LISTEN TO YOUR             
     LITTLE LORD. FARLEN.       

87
00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:09.584
HE HAS MORE SENSE               
THAN YOU DO.                    

88
00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:11.503
    ALL OF YOU SHOULD DO        
    AS HE COMMANDS.             

89
00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:15.223
MY FATHER HAS DONNED            
THE ANCIENT CROWN OF            
SALT AND ROCK                   

90
00:06:15.258 --> 00:06:18.760
AND DECLARED HIMSELF            
KING OF THE IRON ISLANDS.       

91
00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:22.013
  HE CLAIMS THE NORTH AS WELL   
  BY RIGHT OF CONQUEST.         

92
00:06:22.047 --> 00:06:23.815
  YOU ARE ALL HIS SUBJECTS.     

93
00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.568
          BUGGER THAT.          
          I SERVE THE STARKS.   

94
00:06:26.602 --> 00:06:29.988
  - IF YOU THINK YOU CAN        
    HOLD THE NORTH WITH THIS--  
  - SHUT UP!                    

95
00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:33.492
            Theon:              
   <i>IF YOU SERVE ME AS LOYALLY</i>   
 <i>AS YOU SERVED NED STARK.</i>       

96
00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:36.578
 <i>I WILL BE AS GOOD TO YOU</i>       
     <i>AS HE EVER WAS.</i>            

97
00:06:36.612 --> 00:06:38.730
    BETRAY ME. AND YOU WILL     
    WISH YOU HADN'T.            

98
00:06:38.748 --> 00:06:40.499
      ( crowd murmuring )       

99
00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:43.702
    MAESTER LUWIN.              
    SEND A RAVEN TO PYKE        

100
00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:46.421
    INFORMING MY FATHER         
    OF MY VICTORY HERE          

101
00:06:46.456 --> 00:06:49.040
AND ONE TO DEEPWOOD MOTTE       
TO MY SISTER.                   

102
00:06:49.074 --> 00:06:53.378
INFORM HER THAT SHE'S           
TO BRING 500 MEN                
TO WINTERFELL.                  

103
00:06:53.412 --> 00:06:55.797
      <i>( crowd murmuring )</i>       

104
00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:59.101
YOU ARE A MAESTER               
OF THE CITADEL                  

105
00:06:59.135 --> 00:07:02.420
  SWORN TO SERVE THE LORD       
  OF WINTERFELL. ARE YOU NOT?   

106
00:07:02.438 --> 00:07:03.855
                     I AM.      

107
00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.757
      I AM THE LORD             
      OF WINTERFELL             

108
00:07:05.775 --> 00:07:07.726
  AS BRAN JUST INFORMED YOU.    

109
00:07:09.261 --> 00:07:11.363
     SEND THE RAVENS.           

110
00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:15.534
                  MY LORD.      

111
00:07:17.269 --> 00:07:20.322
        MY LORD GREYJOY.        

112
00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:23.875
 I SEE YOU'VE FINALLY LEARNED   
 HOW TO ADDRESS YOUR BETTERS.   

113
00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.443
  WHAT DO YOU WANT?             

114
00:07:25.461 --> 00:07:27.746
          I WAS BROUGHT HERE    
          A CAPTIVE.            

115
00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.132
          YOU WERE HERE THE DAY 
          I WAS TAKEN.          

116
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:34.136
I'M THE ONE WHO TOOK YOU.       
WHAT OF IT?                     

117
00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.888
            LET ME SERVE YOU.   

118
00:07:36.923 --> 00:07:39.508
            Theon:              
         <i>SERVE ME HOW?</i>          

119
00:07:39.559 --> 00:07:42.010
  I NEED FIGHTERS.              
  NOT KITCHEN SLUTS.            

120
00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:45.063
        IT WAS ROBB STARK WHO   
        PUT ME IN THE KITCHENS. 

121
00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:47.632
          PUT A SPEAR           
          IN MY HAND AGAIN.     

122
00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.734
SO YOU CAN BURY IT              
IN MY NECK?                     

123
00:07:49.769 --> 00:07:51.319
DO YOU TAKE ME                  
FOR A FOOL?                     

124
00:07:51.354 --> 00:07:52.804
      GET UP.                   

125
00:07:52.822 --> 00:07:55.907
          STEP ASIDE.           

126
00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:58.193
        WHY?                    

127
00:07:58.244 --> 00:08:01.663
             IT'S YOUR DREAM.   
             LITTLE LORD.       

128
00:08:01.697 --> 00:08:05.149
          THE OCEAN HAS COME    
          TO SWALLOW THIS PLACE.

129
00:08:05.168 --> 00:08:08.119
        I AIN'T LETTING IT      
        DROWN ME.               

130
00:08:08.153 --> 00:08:10.956
  - AND IN A FEW DAYS' TIME--   
  - Rodrik: <i>GREYJOY!</i>            

131
00:08:15.962 --> 00:08:18.046
            Woman:              
         <i>WHAT HAVE THEY</i>         
          <i>DONE TO HIM?</i>          

132
00:08:18.097 --> 00:08:21.165
WE CAUGHT THIS ONE              
ON THIS WAY BACK FROM           
TORRHEN'S SQUARE.               

133
00:08:21.184 --> 00:08:24.135
TOOK OUT TWO OF OURS            
BEFORE I GOT HIS SWORD.         

134
00:08:24.169 --> 00:08:27.606
    SER RODRIK.                 
    IT GRIEVES ME THAT          
    WE MEET AS FOES.            

135
00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:31.476
    IT GRIEVES ME               
    YOU'VE LESS HONOR           
    THAN A BACK ALLEY WHORE.    

136
00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.980
          YOU WERE RAISED HERE  
          UNDER THIS ROOF.      

137
00:08:35.014 --> 00:08:37.682
- THESE PEOPLE ARE YOUR PEOPLE. 
- THEY ARE NOT MY PEOPLE.       

138
00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.918
    KING ROBB THOUGHT OF YOU    
    AS A BROTHER.               

139
00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:42.871
 MY BROTHERS ARE DEAD.          

140
00:08:42.905 --> 00:08:45.690
THEY DIED FIGHTING              
STARK MEN. MEN LIKE YOU.        

141
00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:49.160
     AYE. THEY DIED FIGHTING    
     A WAR YOUR FATHER STARTED. 

142
00:08:49.194 --> 00:08:51.413
         LORD STARK RAISED YOU  
         AMONG HIS OWN SONS.    

143
00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:53.582
  AMONG THEM.                   
  BUT NOT ONE OF THEM.          

144
00:08:53.633 --> 00:08:56.418
  I WAS HIS HOSTAGE             
  TAKEN FROM MY HOME.           

145
00:08:56.469 --> 00:08:58.169
              IF HE WERE ALIVE  
              TO SEE THIS--     

146
00:08:58.203 --> 00:09:00.021
    HE'S NOT.                   
    HE'S DEAD.                  

147
00:09:00.056 --> 00:09:02.140
THE SEVEN KINGDOMS              
ARE AT WAR.                     

148
00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:04.426
AND WINTERFELL IS MINE.         

149
00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.145
          I SHOULD HAVE PUT     
          A SWORD IN YOUR BELLY 

150
00:09:07.179 --> 00:09:08.713
            INSTEAD OF          
            IN YOUR HAND.       

151
00:09:08.731 --> 00:09:11.850
  YOU'VE SERVED THIS HOUSE      
  FAITHFULLY. OLD MAN.          

152
00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.935
BUT KEEP TALKING                
AND I'LL--                      

153
00:09:13.986 --> 00:09:15.770
              ( grunts )        

154
00:09:15.821 --> 00:09:18.773
 TAKE HIM TO THE CELLS.         
 LOCK HIM UP--                  

155
00:09:18.824 --> 00:09:20.525
            MY PRINCE.          

156
00:09:20.559 --> 00:09:23.111
      YOU CANNOT LET THAT STAND.
      HE MUST PAY.              

157
00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:25.063
I'LL LOCK HIM IN A CELL         
UNTIL HE ROTS--                 

158
00:09:25.081 --> 00:09:28.083
          NO. HE HAS TO PAY     
          THE IRON PRICE.       

159
00:09:28.117 --> 00:09:31.235
          THEY'LL NEVER RESPECT 
          YOU WHILE HE LIVES.   

160
00:09:42.598 --> 00:09:46.250
      <i>( thunder rumbles )</i>       

161
00:09:49.588 --> 00:09:51.756
     SER RODRIK.                

162
00:09:51.774 --> 00:09:53.224
  I SENTENCE YOU TO DEATH.      

163
00:09:53.258 --> 00:09:55.727
  NO! YOU SAID NO HARM          
  WOULD COME TO THEM            
  IF I YIELDED.                 

164
00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:58.113
         THE OLD MAN COULDN'T   
         KEEP HIS MOUTH SHUT.   

165
00:09:58.147 --> 00:10:00.815
    I URGE YOU NOT TO MAKE      
    A HASTY DECISION.           

166
00:10:00.866 --> 00:10:03.818
 HE DISRESPECTED ME             
 IN FRONT OF MY MEN.            

167
00:10:03.869 --> 00:10:05.320
 THAT WAS HIS DECISION.         
 NOT MINE.                      

168
00:10:05.371 --> 00:10:07.822
HE IS WORTH MORE                
TO YOU ALIVE THAN DEAD.         

169
00:10:07.873 --> 00:10:10.875
         THE STARKS WILL PAY.   

170
00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:13.745
        PLEASE. THEON.          

171
00:10:13.779 --> 00:10:15.714
      THINK WHAT YOU DO.        

172
00:10:26.342 --> 00:10:28.259
YOU'LL ADDRESS ME               
AS PRINCE THEON                 

173
00:10:28.293 --> 00:10:30.178
OR YOU'LL BE NEXT.              

174
00:10:30.229 --> 00:10:32.180
            COME.               

175
00:10:33.065 --> 00:10:34.632
             NO!                

176
00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.852
         - NO!                  
         - Bran: <i>THEON!</i>         

177
00:10:38.738 --> 00:10:40.805
              PLEASE!           

178
00:10:40.823 --> 00:10:42.691
            SER RODRIK!         

179
00:10:42.742 --> 00:10:45.577
 HE WHO PASSES THE SENTENCE     
 SHOULD SWING THE SWORD.        

180
00:10:45.611 --> 00:10:48.363
- Bran: <i>I'M BEGGING YOU!</i>        
- COWARD.                       

181
00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:54.252
STOP! STOP RIGHT NOW!           

182
00:10:54.286 --> 00:10:56.004
  YOU DON'T GIVE                
  COMMANDS ANYMORE.             
  LITTLE LORD.                  

183
00:10:56.038 --> 00:10:58.707
- PLEASE. STOP THIS.            
  PLEASE STOP HIM.              
- Rodrik: <i>HUSH NOW. CHILD.</i>      

184
00:10:58.758 --> 00:11:01.843
  I'M OFF TO SEE YOUR FATHER.   

185
00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:06.848
Bran:                           
YOU SAID NO HARM                
WOULD COME!                     

186
00:11:06.882 --> 00:11:09.634
  <i>YOU SAID NO HARM WOULD COME.</i>  
         <i>THEON. PLEASE.</i>         

187
00:11:09.668 --> 00:11:12.470
ANY LAST WORDS. OLD MAN?        

188
00:11:12.504 --> 00:11:15.390
        GODS HELP YOU.          
        THEON GREYJOY.          

189
00:11:15.441 --> 00:11:17.525
        NOW YOU ARE TRULY LOST. 

190
00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.011
             Bran:              
     <i>THEON. PLEASE. DON'T.</i>      

191
00:11:20.029 --> 00:11:23.148
- Rickon: <i>DO SOMETHING.</i>         
- Bran: <i>I'LL DO ANYTHING.</i>       
 <i> PLEASE!</i>                       

192
00:11:23.182 --> 00:11:24.816
            Rickon:             
      <i>NO. PLEASE. STOP IT!</i>      

193
00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.401
         - ( grunts )           
         - ( screams )          

194
00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:39.197
     - <i>( Bran wailing )</i>         
     - <i>( thunder rumbling )</i>     

195
00:11:40.532 --> 00:11:43.218
          ( panting )           

196
00:11:47.873 --> 00:11:50.141
    ( wind howling )            

197
00:11:56.232 --> 00:11:58.650
             Jon:               
     GHOST. STAY WITH US.       

198
00:11:58.684 --> 00:12:00.735
            GHOST!              

199
00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:02.404
        THERE GOES YOUR PET.    

200
00:12:02.438 --> 00:12:04.022
             Jon:               
     <i>HE'S NOT A PET.</i>            

201
00:12:04.056 --> 00:12:06.557
             Qhorin:            
             <i>YOU'RE RIGHT.</i>      
             <i>HE'S NOT.</i>          

202
00:12:06.575 --> 00:12:09.160
                YOU CAN'T TAME  
                A WILD THING.   

203
00:12:09.195 --> 00:12:10.945
                YOU CAN'T TRUST 
                A WILD THING.   

204
00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:14.032
     - GHOST IS DIFFERENT.      
     - SO YOU THINK.            

205
00:12:14.066 --> 00:12:16.418
        WILD CREATURES          
        HAVE THEIR OWN RULES.   

206
00:12:16.452 --> 00:12:18.620
        THEIR OWN REASONS.      

207
00:12:18.671 --> 00:12:20.638
            AND YOU'LL NEVER    
            KNOW THEM.          

208
00:12:20.673 --> 00:12:24.342
            NOW THE WILDLINGS   
            WE'RE LOOKING FOR   

209
00:12:24.376 --> 00:12:26.761
            SLEEP DURING THE DAY
            AND HUNT AT NIGHT.  

210
00:12:29.215 --> 00:12:31.766
I THOUGHT YOU SAID              
YOU COULDN'T KNOW               
WILD THINGS.                    

211
00:12:31.801 --> 00:12:33.718
             I SAID YOU CAN'T.  

212
00:12:33.752 --> 00:12:36.771
        THEY FIND A NICE CAVE   
        TO HIDE IN WHILE        
        THE SUN'S UP            

213
00:12:36.806 --> 00:12:38.756
        AND DO THEIR KILLING    
        WHEN IT'S DARK.         

214
00:12:38.774 --> 00:12:41.810
    - WE COULD DO THE SAME.     
    - NO. WE COULDN'T.          

215
00:12:41.861 --> 00:12:44.062
         THIS IS THEIR COUNTRY. 

216
00:12:44.096 --> 00:12:47.115
        THEY KNOW WHERE TO WALK.
        WHERE NOT TO WALK.      

217
00:12:47.149 --> 00:12:49.067
        I'VE LOST GOOD MEN      
        WHO FELL INTO A CREVASSE

218
00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.236
        THEY DIDN'T SEE         
        TILL THEY WERE IN IT.   

219
00:12:52.371 --> 00:12:54.823
MY FATHER ALWAYS SAID           
I'M OF THE NORTH.               

220
00:12:54.874 --> 00:12:56.624
                 ( chuckles )   

221
00:12:56.659 --> 00:12:59.544
      - I WASN'T JOKING.        
      - LOOK AROUND. BOY.       

222
00:12:59.578 --> 00:13:02.797
                THIS LOOK LIKE  
                HOME TO YOU?    

223
00:13:02.832 --> 00:13:06.050
            YOU START THINKING  
            YOU KNOW THIS PLACE.
            IT'LL KILL YOU.     

224
00:13:07.102 --> 00:13:09.387
             YOU UNDERSTAND ME? 

225
00:13:09.421 --> 00:13:11.840
                NO. YOU DON'T.  

226
00:13:11.891 --> 00:13:13.808
                WE'RE AT WAR.   

227
00:13:13.843 --> 00:13:15.510
      WE'VE ALWAYS BEEN AT WAR. 

228
00:13:15.561 --> 00:13:18.096
    IT'S NEVER GOING TO END     
    'CAUSE WE'RE NOT FIGHTING   
    AN ENEMY.                   

229
00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.683
    WE'RE FIGHTING THE NORTH    
    AND IT'S NOT GOING ANYWHERE.

230
00:13:21.734 --> 00:13:24.736
            THE WATCH HAS GIVEN 
            YOU A GREAT GIFT.   

231
00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.305
        YOU ONLY HAVE ONE THING 
        TO GIVE IN RETURN--     

232
00:13:27.323 --> 00:13:28.773
                  YOUR LIFE.    

233
00:13:28.807 --> 00:13:30.141
I'LL GLADLY GIVE MY LIFE.       

234
00:13:30.159 --> 00:13:32.527
        I DON'T WANT YOU        
        TO BE GLAD ABOUT IT.    

235
00:13:32.578 --> 00:13:34.579
            I WANT YOU TO CURSE 
            AND FIGHT           

236
00:13:34.613 --> 00:13:37.031
            UNTIL YOUR HEART'S  
            DONE PUMPING.       

237
00:13:37.082 --> 00:13:39.501
        AND KNOW THIS. BOY--    

238
00:13:39.535 --> 00:13:43.254
     YOUR DEATH WILL BE A GIFT  
     FOR THEM SOUTH OF THE WALL.

239
00:13:43.289 --> 00:13:45.489
             THEY'LL NEVER KNOW 
             WHAT YOU'VE DONE.  

240
00:13:45.508 --> 00:13:47.008
             THEY'LL NEVER KNOW 
             HOW YOU DIED.      

241
00:13:47.042 --> 00:13:49.160
        THEY WON'T EVEN         
        KNOW YOUR DAMN NAME.    

242
00:13:49.178 --> 00:13:52.096
    BUT THEY'LL BE ALIVE BECAUSE
    SOME NAMELESS BASTARD       

243
00:13:52.131 --> 00:13:55.767
      NORTH OF THE WALL         
      GAVE HIS LIFE FOR THEIRS. 

244
00:13:55.801 --> 00:13:58.937
     NOW. DO YOU UNDERSTAND ME? 

245
00:13:58.971 --> 00:14:00.688
        I DO.                   

246
00:14:00.723 --> 00:14:03.107
        YOU'RE EVEN DUMBER      
        THAN YOU LOOK.          

247
00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.361
          IT'S JUST WORDS. BOY. 

248
00:14:06.395 --> 00:14:08.363
        TO KEEP US A LITTLE     
        WARMER IN THE NIGHT.    

249
00:14:08.397 --> 00:14:11.649
        MAKE US FEEL LIKE       
        WE'VE GOT A PURPOSE.    

250
00:14:11.683 --> 00:14:14.118
                ( laughs )      
                COME ON.        

251
00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:17.956
    WE'VE GOT TO FIND THESE     
    GOAT FUCKERS BEFORE NIGHT   
    FALLS AND THEY FIND US.     

252
00:14:29.752 --> 00:14:32.337
        - CAN YOU READ?         
        - MY LORD?              

253
00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:35.406
            CAN YOU READ?       

254
00:14:38.177 --> 00:14:41.479
     THIS LETTER DETAILING      
    OUR INFANTRY MOVEMENTS      

255
00:14:41.513 --> 00:14:44.182
WAS MEANT FOR LORD DAMON        
      OF HOUSE MARBRAND.        

256
00:14:44.216 --> 00:14:48.019
  IT WAS SENT TO LORD MARLYN    
    OF HOUSE DORMAND.           

257
00:14:48.053 --> 00:14:50.054
     MY APOLOGIES. MY LORD.     
     I MUST HAVE--              

258
00:14:50.072 --> 00:14:53.608
GIRL. FETCH ME                  
THE "HISTORY OF THE GREATER     
AND THE LESSER HOUSES."         

259
00:14:53.659 --> 00:14:56.411
IT'S THE ONE ON THE--           
( chuckles )                    

260
00:14:59.398 --> 00:15:02.400
MY CUPBEARER CAN READ           
BETTER THAN YOU.                

261
00:15:11.594 --> 00:15:14.762
    TO WHOM DOES                
    HOUSE DORMAND               
    OWE ALLEGIANCE?             

262
00:15:17.132 --> 00:15:19.217
            MY LORD. I--        

263
00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:22.053
     TO THE STARKS              
     OF WINTERFELL!             

264
00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:26.274
    WHO HAVE 20.000 MEN         
    AND MY SON!                 

265
00:15:27.726 --> 00:15:29.811
I JUDGED YOU MIGHT BE           
GOOD FOR SOMETHING MORE         

266
00:15:29.862 --> 00:15:32.430
THAN BRUTALIZING PEASANTS.      

267
00:15:32.448 --> 00:15:34.782
I SEE I OVERESTIMATED YOU.      

268
00:15:36.285 --> 00:15:39.704
 <i>IF YOU EVER PUT MY SON'S</i>       
 <i>LIFE AT RISK AGAIN. I'LL...</i>    

269
00:15:39.738 --> 00:15:42.240
         LEAVE US.              

270
00:15:50.215 --> 00:15:51.633
PUT THE BOOK AWAY. GIRL.        

271
00:15:51.667 --> 00:15:54.319
         <i>( door opens )</i>         

272
00:15:54.353 --> 00:15:56.888
     <i>( door closes )</i>            

273
00:15:58.507 --> 00:16:02.143
MAYBE YOU SHOULD DEVISE         
OUR NEXT BATTLE PLAN WHILE      
YOU'RE ABOUT IT.                

274
00:16:02.177 --> 00:16:04.178
          <i>( knocking )</i>          

275
00:16:04.229 --> 00:16:06.814
         <i>( door opens )</i>         

276
00:16:06.849 --> 00:16:09.400
      LORD PETYR BAELISH.       

277
00:16:09.435 --> 00:16:11.152
                      MMM.      

278
00:16:11.186 --> 00:16:13.321
GIVE US THE ROOM.               

279
00:16:20.996 --> 00:16:22.830
        CLEAR ALL THIS.         

280
00:16:25.984 --> 00:16:28.786
         - LORD TYWIN.          
         - BAELISH.             

281
00:16:36.845 --> 00:16:39.630
          - WINE?               
          - THANK YOU.          

282
00:16:42.518 --> 00:16:44.469
          WHAT NEWS             
          FROM THE CAPITAL?     

283
00:16:44.503 --> 00:16:47.889
I TRAVELLED HERE DIRECTLY       
FROM RENLY BARATHEON'S CAMP.    

284
00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.108
    AH. THE LATE KING RENLY.    

285
00:16:50.142 --> 00:16:52.343
          RATHER A SHORT REIGN. 

286
00:16:52.361 --> 00:16:54.362
          MURDERED BY A WOMAN.  
          I HEAR.               

287
00:16:54.396 --> 00:16:56.347
    SO THEY SAY.                

288
00:16:56.365 --> 00:17:01.519
    THERE HAS BEEN TALK         
    OF OTHER FORCES AT WORK.    

289
00:17:01.537 --> 00:17:03.988
         DARK FORCES.           

290
00:17:04.022 --> 00:17:06.407
             HERE.              

291
00:17:08.377 --> 00:17:10.828
  ( scoffs )                    
  MEN LOVE TO BLAME DEMONS      

292
00:17:10.862 --> 00:17:14.582
     WHEN THEIR GRAND PLANS     
     UNRAVEL.                   

293
00:17:14.633 --> 00:17:17.418
IT IS MY BELIEF                 
THAT A MOMENT OF CHAOS          

294
00:17:17.469 --> 00:17:19.870
AFFORDS OPPORTUNITIES           
LOST SOON AFTER.                

295
00:17:19.888 --> 00:17:23.040
         YOU SAY THAT AS IF     
         YOU WERE THE FIRST MAN 
         ALIVE TO THINK IT.     

296
00:17:23.058 --> 00:17:26.210
             YES. A CRISIS      
             IS AN OPPORTUNITY. 

297
00:17:26.228 --> 00:17:28.712
        WHAT OTHER BRILLIANT    
        INSIGHTS HAVE YOU       
        BROUGHT ME TODAY?       

298
00:17:28.731 --> 00:17:30.431
AFTER THE LANNISTERS            
AND THE STARKS.                 

299
00:17:30.482 --> 00:17:32.900
THE TYRELLS COMMAND             
THE LARGEST HOST.               

300
00:17:32.935 --> 00:17:35.069
THEIR LANDS ARE THE MOST        
FERTILE IN THE SEVEN KINGDOMS.  

301
00:17:35.104 --> 00:17:39.056
 - FEEDING HORSES AND SOLDIERS. 
 - YES. YES. YES.               

302
00:17:39.074 --> 00:17:43.494
THE TYRELLS HAVE                
NOT YET DECLARED FOR ANY        
OF THE SURVIVING KINGS.         

303
00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:46.697
            LORAS WANTS REVENGE.
            HE BLAMES STANNIS   
            FOR RENLY'S DEATH.  

304
00:17:46.731 --> 00:17:49.400
  AND MARGAERY--                

305
00:17:49.418 --> 00:17:51.202
            WANTS TO BE QUEEN.  

306
00:17:51.236 --> 00:17:54.038
     YES. SHE DOES.             

307
00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:59.093
      HOUSE TYRELL REBELLED     
      AGAINST THE IRON THRONE.  

308
00:17:59.128 --> 00:18:02.713
     - AGAINST MY GRANDSON.     
     - THEY DID.                

309
00:18:02.747 --> 00:18:05.082
AND PERHAPS THAT TREASON        
      SHOULD BE PUNISHED        

310
00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.018
 <i>ONE DAY.</i>                       

311
00:18:07.052 --> 00:18:11.022
         AFTER STANNIS          
        AND ROBB STARK          
         ARE DEFEATED.          

312
00:18:13.258 --> 00:18:15.610
    MORE WINE FOR LORD BAELISH. 

313
00:18:21.733 --> 00:18:24.986
IF YOU WILL ALLOW               
ME TO REPRESENT YOUR            
FAMILY'S INTERESTS.             

314
00:18:25.037 --> 00:18:27.104
    I BELIEVE THAT              
    AN ADVANTAGEOUS             
    AGREEMENT--                 

315
00:18:27.122 --> 00:18:30.208
    THE TYRELL HOST HAS         
    RETURNED TO HIGHGARDEN?     

316
00:18:30.242 --> 00:18:32.410
              THEY HAVE.        

317
00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:34.328
 PARDON. MY LORD.               

318
00:18:34.379 --> 00:18:36.297
             IT'S ONLY WINE.    

319
00:18:37.666 --> 00:18:39.801
            YOU WOULD RIDE      
            THERE YOURSELF?     

320
00:18:39.835 --> 00:18:41.752
      TONIGHT. WITH YOUR LEAVE. 

321
00:18:41.786 --> 00:18:44.005
          I'LL HAVE AN ANSWER   
          BY NIGHTFALL.         

322
00:18:44.056 --> 00:18:45.723
          THAT'LL BE ALL. GIRL. 

323
00:18:51.313 --> 00:18:52.847
              WHAT ELSE?        

324
00:18:52.898 --> 00:18:55.016
    ON YOUR SON                 
    TYRION'S DIRECTIVE.         

325
00:18:55.067 --> 00:18:57.568
I MET WITH CATELYN STARK.       

326
00:18:57.603 --> 00:18:59.103
                WHY?            

327
00:18:59.137 --> 00:19:01.622
 Littlefinger:                  
 <i>HE HAD AN INTERESTING</i>          
 <i>PROPOSAL FOR HER</i>               

328
00:19:01.657 --> 00:19:04.859
  - CONCERNING HER DAUGHTERS.   
  - HMM.                        

329
00:19:33.388 --> 00:19:35.723
         - ( groans )           
         - ( shouting )         

330
00:19:54.126 --> 00:19:57.295
         - A GIRL.              
         - A WILDLING.          

331
00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.714
WE COULD QUESTION HER.          

332
00:19:59.748 --> 00:20:01.716
                YOU COULD.      

333
00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.367
              SHE WON'T ANSWER. 

334
00:20:03.385 --> 00:20:06.870
          I'VE KNOWN A WILDLING 
          TO BITE OFF HIS TONGUE
          INSTEAD OF TALKING.   

335
00:20:08.307 --> 00:20:11.092
      - WHAT'S YOUR NAME?       
      - YGRITTE.                

336
00:20:11.143 --> 00:20:14.211
SHE WAS REACHING FOR THIS AXE   
WHEN YOU GOT TO HER.            

337
00:20:14.229 --> 00:20:17.982
GIVE HER HALF A CHANCE.         
SHE'LL BURY IT IN YOUR FACE.    

338
00:20:18.016 --> 00:20:20.818
         I GAVE YOU MY NAME.    

339
00:20:21.904 --> 00:20:24.572
         I'M JON SNOW.          

340
00:20:31.062 --> 00:20:32.997
    YOU OUGHT TO BURN           
    THEM YOU KILLED.            

341
00:20:33.031 --> 00:20:35.700
 Qhorin:                        
 <i>WE'D NEED A BIG</i>                
 <i>FIRE FOR THAT.</i>                 

342
00:20:35.734 --> 00:20:39.737
        TELL ME. YGRITTE.       

343
00:20:39.755 --> 00:20:41.789
        WHY DO YOU WANT US      
        TO BUILD A BIG FIRE?    

344
00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:45.075
ARE THERE SOME MORE             
FRIENDS IN THE AREA?            

345
00:20:45.093 --> 00:20:48.429
BURN THEM OR MAYBE YOU'LL       
NEED THOSE SWORDS AGAIN.        

346
00:20:48.463 --> 00:20:51.015
OUR BOY HERE'S ALREADY          
KILLED ONE DEAD MAN.            

347
00:20:51.049 --> 00:20:53.434
HE CAN DO IT AGAIN              
IF HE HAS TO.                   

348
00:20:53.468 --> 00:20:56.053
WHAT WAITS                      
BEYOND THE PASS?                

349
00:20:56.087 --> 00:20:58.122
        - THE FREE FOLK.        
        - HOW MANY?             

350
00:20:58.156 --> 00:21:00.024
         ( chuckles )           

351
00:21:00.058 --> 00:21:01.976
    HUNDREDS AND THOUSANDS.     

352
00:21:02.027 --> 00:21:04.562
    MORE THAN YOU'VE            
    EVER SEEN. CROW.            

353
00:21:04.596 --> 00:21:07.982
WHY COME TO THE MOUNTAINS?      

354
00:21:08.033 --> 00:21:10.952
WHAT'S IN THE FROSTFANGS        
YOUR KING COULD WANT?           

355
00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.911
DO YOU MEAN TO MARCH            
ON THE WALL?                    

356
00:21:26.969 --> 00:21:29.136
          DO YOU KNOW           
        WHO I AM. GIRL?         

357
00:21:29.171 --> 00:21:31.672
        QHORIN HALFHAND.        

358
00:21:31.723 --> 00:21:33.207
TELL ME TRUE.                   

359
00:21:33.241 --> 00:21:36.510
IF YOUR PEOPLE CAPTURED ME.     

360
00:21:36.561 --> 00:21:38.512
WOULD THEY TAKE ME PRISONER?    

361
00:21:38.547 --> 00:21:40.731
    THEY'D TAKE YOUR HEAD       
    OFF YOUR SHOULDERS          

362
00:21:40.766 --> 00:21:42.850
      IF THEY WAS FEELING KIND. 

363
00:21:42.901 --> 00:21:45.486
        IF NOT.                 
        THEY'D KILL YOU SLOW.   

364
00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:48.138
      ( sighs )                 

365
00:21:48.156 --> 00:21:50.524
WE HAVE NO FOOD FOR HER.        

366
00:21:50.575 --> 00:21:52.910
CAN'T SPARE A MAN               
TO WATCH HER.                   

367
00:21:52.944 --> 00:21:56.163
CAN'T LET HER GO.               
SHE'LL BRING MANCE RAYDER'S     
ARMY DOWN ON US.                

368
00:21:56.198 --> 00:21:58.148
IT NEEDS TO BE DONE.            

369
00:21:58.166 --> 00:22:00.668
      - WANT ME TO DO IT?       
      - NO.                     

370
00:22:00.702 --> 00:22:03.037
      NO. I'LL DO IT.           

371
00:22:04.673 --> 00:22:06.757
COME. BROTHERS.                 

372
00:22:06.792 --> 00:22:08.876
WE'LL LEAVE HIM TO IT.          

373
00:22:08.927 --> 00:22:10.928
WE'LL MEET YOU                  
AT THE TOP.                     

374
00:22:10.962 --> 00:22:12.463
DON'T TAKE TOO LONG.            

375
00:22:12.497 --> 00:22:14.131
WE'RE DEEP IN                   
THEIR COUNTRY NOW.              

376
00:22:19.337 --> 00:22:22.189
       <i>( bird screeches )</i>       

377
00:22:26.828 --> 00:22:30.648
        YOU NEVER KILLED        
        A WOMAN BEFORE. DID YOU?

378
00:22:30.682 --> 00:22:33.484
        YOU DON'T NEED          
        TO DO IT.               

379
00:22:33.518 --> 00:22:35.720
          MANCE WOULD TAKE YOU. 
          I KNOW HE WOULD.      

380
00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:38.155
        THERE'S SECRET WAYS.    

381
00:22:38.189 --> 00:22:41.409
             THE CROWS WOULD    
             NEVER CATCH US.    

382
00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:44.628
 I'M AS MUCH A CROW             
 AS THEY ARE.                   

383
00:22:56.391 --> 00:22:58.476
        WILL YOU BURN ME...     

384
00:22:58.510 --> 00:23:00.511
                 AFTER?         

385
00:23:00.545 --> 00:23:03.046
    CAN'T.                      

386
00:23:03.065 --> 00:23:05.549
SOMEONE MIGHT                   
SEE THE SMOKE.                  

387
00:23:11.222 --> 00:23:13.557
         STRIKE HARD AND TRUE.  

388
00:23:13.575 --> 00:23:15.776
             JON SNOW.          

389
00:23:15.827 --> 00:23:18.329
        OR I'LL COME BACK       
        AND HAUNT YOU.          

390
00:23:22.167 --> 00:23:25.086
            THAT'S COLD.        

391
00:23:27.289 --> 00:23:28.839
            GO ON.              

392
00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:30.958
        BE QUICK ABOUT IT.      

393
00:23:38.249 --> 00:23:39.750
                DO IT.          

394
00:23:43.054 --> 00:23:45.106
        BASTARD. DO IT!         

395
00:23:46.775 --> 00:23:48.726
         - ( grunts )           
         - <i>( clangs )</i>           

396
00:23:54.199 --> 00:23:56.317
  ( breathing heavily )         

397
00:23:56.368 --> 00:23:58.486
              ( grunts )        

398
00:24:55.594 --> 00:24:57.044
          ( grunts )            

399
00:24:58.162 --> 00:25:00.464
            ( panting )         

400
00:25:00.498 --> 00:25:03.717
              YOU CAN'T DO IT.  
              WE BOTH KNOW IT.  

401
00:25:08.223 --> 00:25:10.925
            THE SUN'S GOING     
            DOWN. JON SNOW.     

402
00:25:10.959 --> 00:25:14.111
            AND YOUR FRIENDS    
            ARE NOWHERE CLOSE.  

403
00:25:14.145 --> 00:25:15.512
    I'LL FIND THEM.             

404
00:25:15.530 --> 00:25:19.200
              CALL FOR THEM.    
              GO ON.            

405
00:25:19.234 --> 00:25:21.118
              CALL LOUDLY.      

406
00:25:28.076 --> 00:25:30.544
 Man:                           
 <i>MAY THE SEVEN GUIDE</i>            
 <i>THE PRINCESS ON HER JOURNEY.</i>   

407
00:25:30.579 --> 00:25:31.996
          ( crying )            

408
00:25:32.030 --> 00:25:33.864
   <i>MAY THE MOTHER</i>               
   <i>GIVE HER HEALTH.</i>             

409
00:25:33.882 --> 00:25:36.333
         MAY THE CRONE          
    GIVE HER WISDOM.            

410
00:25:36.367 --> 00:25:39.336
MAY THE WARRIOR                 
GIVE HER COURAGE.               

411
00:25:39.370 --> 00:25:42.139
     - ( crying )               
     - <i>( septon continues )</i>     

412
00:25:44.392 --> 00:25:46.594
 ONE DAY I PRAY                 
 YOU LOVE SOMEONE.              

413
00:25:47.596 --> 00:25:50.314
 I PRAY YOU LOVE                
 HER SO MUCH.                   

414
00:25:50.348 --> 00:25:52.733
 <i>WHEN YOU CLOSE YOUR EYES.</i>      
 <i>YOU SEE HER FACE.</i>              

415
00:25:54.819 --> 00:25:57.605
I WANT THAT FOR YOU.            

416
00:25:57.656 --> 00:26:01.191
I WANT YOU TO KNOW WHAT         
IT'S LIKE TO LOVE SOMEONE.      

417
00:26:01.225 --> 00:26:04.411
 TO TRULY LOVE SOMEONE.         

418
00:26:04.446 --> 00:26:06.830
  BEFORE I TAKE HER             
  FROM YOU.                     

419
00:26:12.837 --> 00:26:15.956
      <i>( septon continues )</i>      

420
00:26:18.960 --> 00:26:21.929
              ( crying )        

421
00:26:24.248 --> 00:26:27.134
            YOU SOUND LIKE      
            A LITTLE CAT MEWLING
            FOR HIS MOTHER.     

422
00:26:27.185 --> 00:26:28.686
            PRINCES DON'T CRY.  

423
00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:31.522
    - I SAW YOU CRY.            
    - DID YOU SAY SOMETHING.    
      MY LADY?                  

424
00:26:31.556 --> 00:26:34.825
MY LITTLE BROTHER CRIED         
WHEN I LEFT WINTERFELL.         

425
00:26:34.859 --> 00:26:36.894
                     SO?        

426
00:26:36.928 --> 00:26:38.112
IT SEEMS A NORMAL THING.        

427
00:26:38.146 --> 00:26:40.147
          IS YOUR LITTLE BROTHER
          A PRINCE?             

428
00:26:40.198 --> 00:26:42.283
    NO.                         

429
00:26:42.317 --> 00:26:44.702
          NOT REALLY RELEVANT.  
          THEN. IS IT?          

430
00:26:48.540 --> 00:26:50.574
    COME. DOG.                  

431
00:26:58.166 --> 00:27:00.000
             Man:               
         <i>HAIL. JOFFREY!</i>         

432
00:27:00.051 --> 00:27:02.720
      - <i>HAIL TO THE KING.</i>       
      - <i>( man laughs )</i>          

433
00:27:04.723 --> 00:27:06.223
    SEVEN BLESSINGS ON YOU.     
          YOUR GRACE.           

434
00:27:06.257 --> 00:27:08.726
             Man:               
       <i>MURDERER! BASTARD!</i>       

435
00:27:08.760 --> 00:27:10.060
    ALL HAIL THE KING.          

436
00:27:10.095 --> 00:27:12.429
             Man:               
         <i>HE'S NO KING.</i>          
     <i>HE'S A BASTARD!</i>            

437
00:27:12.463 --> 00:27:14.098
      <i>( people laughing )</i>       

438
00:27:14.132 --> 00:27:15.899
  PLEASE. YOUR GRACE.           
  WE'RE HUNGRY.                 

439
00:27:15.934 --> 00:27:18.736
       <i>( crowd shouting )</i>       

440
00:27:18.770 --> 00:27:21.822
     - Man: <i>FREAK!</i>              
     - GET THE PRINCE BACK      
       TO THE KEEP NOW.         

441
00:27:21.856 --> 00:27:24.191
      YES. MY LORD.             
      COME. QUICKLY.            

442
00:27:24.242 --> 00:27:26.193
            Woman:              
      <i>PLEASE. YOUR GRACE.</i>       
       <i>GIVE US SOME FOOD!</i>       

443
00:27:26.244 --> 00:27:29.079
             Man:               
       <i>BREAD. YOUR GRACE.</i>       
         <i>PLEASE!</i>                

444
00:27:30.481 --> 00:27:31.982
    - ( groans )                
    - ( crowd gasps )           

445
00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:33.784
          WHO THREW THAT?       

446
00:27:33.818 --> 00:27:35.786
         <i>I WANT THE MAN</i>         
     <i>WHO THREW THAT.</i>            

447
00:27:35.820 --> 00:27:37.671
        FIND WHO DID THAT       
        AND BRING HIM TO ME!    

448
00:27:37.706 --> 00:27:39.006
    - HOLD ON!                  
    - <i>HOLD THEM BACK!</i>           

449
00:27:39.040 --> 00:27:41.542
        Joffrey:                
     <i>JUST KILL THEM!</i>            
         <i>KILL THEM ALL!</i>         

450
00:27:47.298 --> 00:27:49.666
    - MOVE. MOVE!               
    - Man: <i>PULL BACK!</i>           

451
00:27:49.684 --> 00:27:51.635
             Man:               
      <i>TEAR HIM TO PIECES!</i>       

452
00:27:51.669 --> 00:27:54.688
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?             
I WANT THESE PEOPLE EXECUTED!   

453
00:27:54.723 --> 00:27:57.024
    AND THEY WANT               
    THE SAME FOR YOU.           

454
00:28:10.021 --> 00:28:12.489
     ( septon screaming )       

455
00:28:19.197 --> 00:28:21.915
         ( cheering )           

456
00:28:23.201 --> 00:28:25.502
        WHERE'S SANSA?          

457
00:28:26.755 --> 00:28:28.839
- ( screaming )                 
- Man: <i>THROUGH THE DOOR!</i>        

458
00:28:28.873 --> 00:28:30.841
    - ( growls )                
    - Man #2: <i>COME ON!</i>          

459
00:28:30.875 --> 00:28:32.976
        ( shouting )            

460
00:28:35.263 --> 00:28:36.346
     ( whimpering )             

461
00:28:36.380 --> 00:28:37.564
    PROTECT THE KING!           

462
00:28:37.599 --> 00:28:40.350
          - GET BACK!           
         - FALL BACK!           

463
00:28:40.384 --> 00:28:42.603
        - MOVE!                 
        - TO THE GATES!         

464
00:28:54.582 --> 00:28:57.868
      - COME IN! COME IN!       
      - KEEP HIM SAFE!          

465
00:28:57.902 --> 00:29:00.237
    - ( crowd shouting )        
    - People: MOTHERFUCKER!     

466
00:29:00.255 --> 00:29:03.457
    - WATCH OUT.                
      HOLD THEM BACK.           
    - COME ON.                  

467
00:29:06.878 --> 00:29:08.912
    ( whimpers )                

468
00:29:10.414 --> 00:29:12.966
          - HEY!                
          - ( laughs )          

469
00:29:13.017 --> 00:29:14.751
        TRAITORS!               

470
00:29:14.769 --> 00:29:16.637
        I'LL HAVE               
    ALL THEIR HEADS.            

471
00:29:16.688 --> 00:29:18.522
                 OH. YOU BLIND. 
                 BLOODY FOOL.   

472
00:29:18.556 --> 00:29:20.474
  YOU CAN'T INSULT ME.          

473
00:29:20.525 --> 00:29:23.393
    WE'VE HAD VICIOUS KINGS     
  AND WE'VE HAD IDIOT KINGS.    

474
00:29:23.427 --> 00:29:26.313
     BUT I DON'T KNOW IF        
     WE'VE EVER BEEN CURSED WITH
     A VICIOUS IDIOT FOR A KING.

475
00:29:26.364 --> 00:29:28.115
         - YOU CAN'T--          
        - I CAN. I AM.          

476
00:29:28.149 --> 00:29:29.650
 THEY ATTACKED ME!              

477
00:29:29.701 --> 00:29:33.203
          THEY THREW A COW PIE  
          AT YOU. SO YOU DECIDED
          TO KILL THEM ALL?     

478
00:29:33.238 --> 00:29:34.988
          THEY'RE STARVING.     
          YOU FOOL.             

479
00:29:35.039 --> 00:29:36.874
          ALL BECAUSE OF A WAR  
          YOU STARTED.          

480
00:29:36.908 --> 00:29:39.409
YOU'RE TALKING TO A KING!       
( shrieks )                     

481
00:29:39.443 --> 00:29:41.662
    AND NOW I'VE STRUCK A KING. 

482
00:29:41.713 --> 00:29:43.881
        DID MY HAND FALL        
        FROM MY WRIST?          

483
00:29:43.915 --> 00:29:45.916
    WHERE IS THE STARK GIRL?    

484
00:29:45.950 --> 00:29:47.468
    LET THEM HAVE HER.          

485
00:29:47.502 --> 00:29:50.954
      IF SHE DIES. YOU'LL NEVER 
      GET YOUR UNCLE JAIME BACK.

486
00:29:50.972 --> 00:29:53.807
        YOU OWE HIM QUITE A BIT.
        YOU KNOW.               

487
00:29:55.510 --> 00:29:56.977
          ( panting )           

488
00:30:02.300 --> 00:30:04.184
     - WHERE ARE YOU GOING?     
     - ( cloth rips )           

489
00:30:04.235 --> 00:30:07.988
     - ( laughing )             
     - YOU EVER BEEN FUCKED.    
       LITTLE GIRL?             

490
00:30:08.022 --> 00:30:11.325
        - ( whimpering )        
        - COME HERE.            

491
00:30:11.359 --> 00:30:13.377
                TAKE SOME MEN   
                AND GO AND FIND 
                THE STARK GIRL. 

492
00:30:13.411 --> 00:30:15.329
     I TAKE MY ORDERS           
     FROM THE KING.             

493
00:30:16.814 --> 00:30:19.082
             Man:               
           <i>THIS WAY!</i>            

494
00:30:19.117 --> 00:30:21.835
         ( screaming )          

495
00:30:24.455 --> 00:30:27.207
          ( sobbing )           
            PLEASE!             

496
00:30:27.258 --> 00:30:29.009
            NO. NO.             

497
00:30:32.263 --> 00:30:34.631
            ( screams )         

498
00:30:36.434 --> 00:30:37.968
            ( choking )         

499
00:30:38.002 --> 00:30:40.053
            ( grunts )          

500
00:30:44.142 --> 00:30:45.726
    ( grunts )                  

501
00:30:45.777 --> 00:30:48.145
    ( Sansa breathing heavily ) 

502
00:30:48.179 --> 00:30:49.730
        PLEASE!                 

503
00:30:52.033 --> 00:30:54.451
     YOU'RE ALL RIGHT NOW.      
         LITTLE BIRD.           

504
00:30:54.485 --> 00:30:56.403
YOU'RE ALL RIGHT.               

505
00:30:59.991 --> 00:31:01.909
      ( crowd shouting )        

506
00:31:01.960 --> 00:31:03.911
          ( screams )           

507
00:31:09.817 --> 00:31:13.837
     - Man: <i>WE'LL GET YOU.</i>      
      <i> WE'LL GET YOU.</i>           
     - Man #2: <i>THIS WAY.</i>        

508
00:31:15.924 --> 00:31:17.424
            ARE YOU HURT.       
            MY LADY?            

509
00:31:17.475 --> 00:31:19.092
THE LITTLE BIRD'S               
BLEEDING.                       

510
00:31:19.143 --> 00:31:20.877
     SOMEONE TAKE HER BACK      
         TO HER CAGE.           

511
00:31:20.895 --> 00:31:22.763
     <i>SEE TO THAT CUT.</i>           

512
00:31:22.814 --> 00:31:24.348
            WELL DONE. CLEGANE. 

513
00:31:25.216 --> 00:31:27.351
 I DIDN'T DO IT FOR YOU.        

514
00:31:29.320 --> 00:31:31.071
                 HE SHOULDN'T   
                 MAKE ME WAIT.  

515
00:31:31.105 --> 00:31:35.576
          THE SPICE KING IS     
          THE SECOND WEALTHIEST 
          MAN IN QARTH.         

516
00:31:35.610 --> 00:31:37.744
        HE MAKES EVERYONE WAIT. 

517
00:31:37.779 --> 00:31:41.031
OF COURSE. YOU COULD HAVE       
AVOIDED THIS EMBARRASSMENT      

518
00:31:41.065 --> 00:31:43.533
IF YOU MARRIED                  
THE WEALTHIEST MAN IN QARTH.    

519
00:31:43.567 --> 00:31:45.586
      I ALREADY HAVE A HUSBAND. 

520
00:31:45.620 --> 00:31:47.955
        KHAL DROGO IS GONE.     
        KHALEESI.               

521
00:31:48.006 --> 00:31:51.875
          YOU ARE FAR TOO YOUNG 
          TO BE A WIDOW FOREVER 

522
00:31:51.909 --> 00:31:54.211
         AND FAR TOO BEAUTIFUL. 

523
00:31:54.245 --> 00:31:56.013
AND YOU ARE FAR TOO SMART       

524
00:31:56.047 --> 00:31:59.516
TO THINK THAT I WILL            
SUCCUMB TO FLATTERY.            

525
00:31:59.550 --> 00:32:01.468
        I HAVE TRAVELLED        
        VERY FAR IN MY LIFE     

526
00:32:01.519 --> 00:32:03.220
        AND MET MANY WOMEN.     

527
00:32:03.254 --> 00:32:05.055
      BUT NONE THAT ARE         
      IMMUNE TO FLATTERY.       

528
00:32:05.089 --> 00:32:07.774
- <i>THE MOTHER OF DRAGONS!</i>        
- AH.                           

529
00:32:07.809 --> 00:32:09.810
      HERE HE COMES.            

530
00:32:09.861 --> 00:32:13.447
            FORGIVE ME.         
            I HAD TERRIBLE      
            DREAMS LAST NIGHT.  

531
00:32:13.481 --> 00:32:15.115
            TERRIBLE DREAMS.    

532
00:32:15.149 --> 00:32:18.318
    I COULD NOT SLEEP           
    UNTIL THE SUN WAS SHINING   

533
00:32:18.369 --> 00:32:20.854
AND THE BIRDS WERE SINGING.     

534
00:32:20.888 --> 00:32:23.624
 <i>LOOK WHAT A BEAUTY YOU ARE</i>     

535
00:32:23.658 --> 00:32:26.243
 <i>NOW THE RED WASTE</i>              
 <i>HAS BEEN WASHED OFF YOU.</i>       

536
00:32:26.277 --> 00:32:29.613
        I AM SORRY ABOUT        
        ALL THAT UNPLEASANTNESS.

537
00:32:29.647 --> 00:32:34.117
         THE SILVER HAIR        
         OF A TRUE TARGARYEN.   

538
00:32:34.135 --> 00:32:37.587
         XARO XHOAN DAXOS.      
         SHE IS FAR TOO LOVELY  

539
00:32:37.621 --> 00:32:40.140
    FOR A GLORIFIED             
    DOCKWORKER LIKE YOURSELF.   

540
00:32:40.174 --> 00:32:43.727
VERY TRUE. AND YET THEY SAY     
THAT YOUR GRANDFATHER.          

541
00:32:43.761 --> 00:32:45.812
WHO SOLD PEPPER                 
OFF THE BACK OF A WAGON.        

542
00:32:45.847 --> 00:32:49.249
MARRIED A LADY FAR LOVELIER     
AND HIGHER BORN THAN HIMSELF.   

543
00:32:49.283 --> 00:32:51.518
        EVERY LADY ALIVE        
        WAS LOVELIER            

544
00:32:51.569 --> 00:32:53.803
        AND HIGHER BORN         
        THAN MY GRANDFATHER.    

545
00:32:53.821 --> 00:32:55.672
    - ( laughs )                
    - Daenerys: <i>AHEM.</i>           

546
00:32:55.707 --> 00:32:59.242
            DID MY SERVANTS NOT 
            OFFER YOU SOMETHING 
            TO EAT. TO DRINK?   

547
00:32:59.277 --> 00:33:01.194
          I'LL HAVE THEM FLOGGED
          IN THE SQUARE.        

548
00:33:01.245 --> 00:33:03.163
  THANK YOU. MY LORD.           
  YOU ARE A GRACIOUS HOST.      

549
00:33:03.197 --> 00:33:06.116
BUT THERE IS NO SERVANT ALIVE   
THAT CAN BRING ME WHAT I WANT.  

550
00:33:06.150 --> 00:33:08.952
          OH. SHE HAS A TALENT  
          FOR DRAMA. THIS ONE.  

551
00:33:08.986 --> 00:33:13.090
         SO. MY LITTLE PRINCESS.
         WHAT IS IT YOU WANT?   

552
00:33:13.157 --> 00:33:14.541
              MY BIRTHRIGHT--   

553
00:33:14.592 --> 00:33:16.493
             THE SEVEN KINGDOMS 
             OF WESTEROS.       

554
00:33:16.511 --> 00:33:19.196
      I FEAR I'M NO BETTER THAN 
      A SERVANT IN THIS REGARD. 

555
00:33:19.230 --> 00:33:21.281
        I CANNOT GIVE YOU       
        WHAT I DO NOT HAVE.     

556
00:33:21.315 --> 00:33:23.934
        I'M NOT ASKING YOU      
        FOR THE KINGDOMS.       

557
00:33:23.968 --> 00:33:25.719
              I'M ASKING YOU    
              FOR SHIPS.        

558
00:33:25.770 --> 00:33:27.387
              I NEED TO CROSS   
              THE NARROW SEA.   

559
00:33:27.438 --> 00:33:29.306
I NEED MY SHIPS AS WELL.        

560
00:33:29.340 --> 00:33:30.807
I USE THEM. YOU SEE.            

561
00:33:30.841 --> 00:33:33.310
TO BRING SPICES FROM            
ONE PORT TO ANOTHER.            

562
00:33:33.344 --> 00:33:34.844
 WHATEVER YOU GRANT ME          
 NOW WILL BE REPAID             

563
00:33:34.862 --> 00:33:37.631
 THREE TIMES OVER WHEN          
 I RETAKE THE IRON THRONE.      

564
00:33:37.665 --> 00:33:39.116
                RETAKE?         

565
00:33:39.150 --> 00:33:41.284
            DID YOU ONCE SIT    
            ON THE IRON THRONE? 

566
00:33:41.319 --> 00:33:44.154
MY FATHER SAT THERE             
BEFORE HE WAS MURDERED.         

567
00:33:44.188 --> 00:33:46.540
          BUT IF YOU DID NOT    
          SIT ON IT YOURSELF.   

568
00:33:46.574 --> 00:33:50.026
    WOULD IT NOT BE CORRECT     
    TO SAY TAKE THE IRON THRONE?

569
00:33:50.044 --> 00:33:52.079
  I DIDN'T COME HERE            
  TO ARGUE GRAMMAR.             

570
00:33:52.130 --> 00:33:54.998
      OF COURSE NOT.            
      YOU CAME TO TAKE MY SHIPS.

571
00:33:55.033 --> 00:33:57.584
            SO LET ME EXPLAIN   
            MY POSITION.        

572
00:33:57.635 --> 00:33:59.553
         LITTLE PRINCESS.       

573
00:33:59.587 --> 00:34:03.056
         UNLIKE YOU. I DO NOT   
         HAVE EXALTED ANCESTORS.

574
00:34:03.091 --> 00:34:05.058
     I MAKE MY LIVING BY TRADE. 

575
00:34:05.093 --> 00:34:08.428
    AND I JUDGE EVERY TRADE     
    ON ITS MERITS.              

576
00:34:08.463 --> 00:34:10.097
          YOU ASK FOR SHIPS.    

577
00:34:10.148 --> 00:34:13.183
        YOU SAY I SHALL BE      
        REPAID TRIPLE.          

578
00:34:13.217 --> 00:34:16.019
     I DO NOT DOUBT YOUR HONESTY
     OR YOUR INTENTIONS.        

579
00:34:16.054 --> 00:34:18.271
          BUT BEFORE YOU        
          REPAY YOUR DEBTS.     

580
00:34:18.322 --> 00:34:20.907
          YOU MUST SEIZE        
          THE SEVEN KINGDOMS.   

581
00:34:20.942 --> 00:34:23.610
     - DO YOU HAVE AN ARMY?     
     - NOT YET.                 

582
00:34:23.644 --> 00:34:25.112
    YOU DO NOT HAVE AN ARMY.    

583
00:34:25.163 --> 00:34:27.247
        DO YOU HAVE POWERFUL    
        ALLIES IN WESTEROS?     

584
00:34:27.281 --> 00:34:29.416
 THERE ARE MANY THERE           
 THAT SUPPORT MY CLAIM.         

585
00:34:29.450 --> 00:34:30.934
             WHEN WERE YOU      
             THERE LAST?        

586
00:34:31.919 --> 00:34:33.570
     I LEFT WHEN                
     I WAS A BABY.              

587
00:34:33.588 --> 00:34:36.506
        SO. IN TRUTH.           
        YOU HAVE NO ALLIES.     

588
00:34:36.541 --> 00:34:40.977
THE PEOPLE WILL RISE            
TO FIGHT FOR THEIR RIGHTFUL     
QUEEN WHEN I RETURN.            

589
00:34:41.012 --> 00:34:42.879
                  AH.           

590
00:34:42.913 --> 00:34:44.681
        FORGIVE ME.             
        LITTLE PRINCESS.        

591
00:34:44.715 --> 00:34:48.135
          BUT I CANNOT MAKE     
          AN INVESTMENT BASED   
          ON WISHES AND DREAMS. 

592
00:34:48.186 --> 00:34:49.636
    NOW IF YOU'LL PARDON ME.    

593
00:34:49.687 --> 00:34:52.372
DO YOU KNOW ILLYRIO MOPATIS.    
MAGISTER OF PENTOS?             

594
00:34:52.406 --> 00:34:55.058
            YES. WE'VE MET.     
            A SHREWD MAN.       

595
00:34:55.092 --> 00:34:58.695
FOR MY WEDDING HE GAVE ME       
THREE PETRIFIED DRAGON EGGS.    

596
00:34:58.729 --> 00:35:01.598
 <i>HE BELIEVED--</i>                  
 <i>THE WORLD BELIEVED--</i>           

597
00:35:01.616 --> 00:35:03.567
THAT THE AGES                   
HAD TURNED THEM TO STONE.       

598
00:35:03.601 --> 00:35:06.787
HOW MANY CENTURIES HAS IT BEEN  
SINCE DRAGONS ROAMED THE SKIES? 

599
00:35:06.821 --> 00:35:09.790
BUT I DREAMT THAT               
IF I CARRIED THOSE EGGS         

600
00:35:09.824 --> 00:35:12.292
INTO A GREAT FIRE.              
THEY WOULD HATCH.               

601
00:35:12.326 --> 00:35:16.880
WHEN I STEPPED INTO             
THE FIRE. MY OWN PEOPLE         
THOUGHT I WAS MAD.              

602
00:35:16.914 --> 00:35:19.082
BUT WHEN THE FIRE               
BURNED OUT.                     

603
00:35:19.116 --> 00:35:21.301
  I WAS UNHURT.                 

604
00:35:21.335 --> 00:35:24.171
 THE MOTHER OF DRAGONS.         

605
00:35:26.757 --> 00:35:29.009
     DO YOU UNDERSTAND?         

606
00:35:31.596 --> 00:35:34.147
 I'M NO ORDINARY WOMAN.         

607
00:35:34.182 --> 00:35:37.150
 MY DREAMS COME TRUE.           

608
00:35:41.939 --> 00:35:44.191
 I ADMIRE YOUR PASSION.         

609
00:35:45.809 --> 00:35:49.112
BUT IN BUSINESS. I TRUST        
IN LOGIC. NOT PASSION.          

610
00:35:49.146 --> 00:35:50.813
I'M SORRY. LITTLE PRINCESS.     

611
00:35:50.832 --> 00:35:53.166
         I AM NOT               
         YOUR LITTLE PRINCESS.  

612
00:35:53.201 --> 00:35:56.253
    I AM DAENERYS STORMBORN     
  OF THE BLOOD OF OLD VALYRIA   

613
00:35:56.287 --> 00:35:58.288
        AND I WILL TAKE         
         WHAT IS MINE.          

614
00:35:58.322 --> 00:36:01.424
     WITH FIRE AND BLOOD.       
        I WILL TAKE IT.         

615
00:36:01.459 --> 00:36:05.011
         YES. MY LADY.          
    BUT NOT WITH MY SHIPS.      

616
00:36:22.446 --> 00:36:25.565
WHO TAUGHT YOU TO READ?         

617
00:36:25.616 --> 00:36:27.868
        MY FATHER. MY LORD.     

618
00:36:27.902 --> 00:36:29.870
HMM.                            

619
00:36:29.904 --> 00:36:32.122
  I TAUGHT MY SON               
  JAIME TO READ.                

620
00:36:35.126 --> 00:36:37.127
  THE MAESTER CAME              
  TO ME ONE DAY.                

621
00:36:37.161 --> 00:36:39.329
TOLD ME HE WASN'T LEARNING.     

622
00:36:39.363 --> 00:36:42.132
 HE COULDN'T MAKE SENSE         
 OF THE LETTERS.                

623
00:36:42.166 --> 00:36:44.867
HE REVERSED THEM                
IN HIS HEAD.                    

624
00:36:44.886 --> 00:36:47.721
THE MAESTER SAID HE'D HEARD     
TELL OF THIS AFFLICTION         

625
00:36:47.755 --> 00:36:49.806
AND THAT WE SIMPLY              
MUST ACCEPT IT.                 

626
00:36:49.840 --> 00:36:51.892
  HA!                           

627
00:36:51.926 --> 00:36:55.395
 AFTER THAT.                    
 I SAT JAIME DOWN               

628
00:36:55.429 --> 00:36:58.598
 FOR FOUR HOURS EVERY DAY       
 UNTIL HE LEARNED.              

629
00:36:58.649 --> 00:37:03.853
 HE HATED ME FOR IT.            
 FOR A TIME.                    

630
00:37:03.887 --> 00:37:06.523
 FOR A LONG TIME.               

631
00:37:06.557 --> 00:37:08.391
 BUT HE LEARNED.                

632
00:37:13.164 --> 00:37:16.249
 WHERE IS YOUR FATHER?          
 IS HE ALIVE?                   

633
00:37:19.236 --> 00:37:20.754
    WHO WAS HE?                 

634
00:37:20.788 --> 00:37:23.406
             A STONEMASON.      

635
00:37:23.441 --> 00:37:25.742
A STONEMASON                    
WHO COULD READ?                 

636
00:37:25.760 --> 00:37:28.178
      - HMM.                    
      - HE TAUGHT HIMSELF.      

637
00:37:28.212 --> 00:37:30.931
      QUITE A MAN.              

638
00:37:31.966 --> 00:37:34.284
     WHAT KILLED HIM?           

639
00:37:35.886 --> 00:37:38.021
                LOYALTY.        

640
00:37:39.557 --> 00:37:41.708
YOU'RE A SHARP                  
LITTLE THING. AREN'T YOU?       

641
00:37:45.095 --> 00:37:46.396
                  DID...        

642
00:37:48.199 --> 00:37:51.534
      FORGIVE ME. MY LORD.      
      I SHOULDN'T ASK QUESTIONS.

643
00:37:52.536 --> 00:37:54.788
          NO...                 

644
00:37:54.822 --> 00:37:57.741
 BUT YOU'VE ALREADY BEGUN.      

645
00:37:57.775 --> 00:38:01.211
         DID YOU KNOW           
         YOUR FATHER. MY LORD?  

646
00:38:01.245 --> 00:38:03.380
         I DID.                 

647
00:38:04.799 --> 00:38:06.583
     I GREW UP WITH HIM.        

648
00:38:08.502 --> 00:38:11.421
         I WATCHED HIM          
        GROW OLD.               

649
00:38:15.009 --> 00:38:16.726
                  <i>HE LOVED US.</i>  

650
00:38:16.761 --> 00:38:19.562
             HE WAS A GOOD MAN. 

651
00:38:19.597 --> 00:38:22.298
              BUT A WEAK MAN.   

652
00:38:22.316 --> 00:38:25.819
            A WEAK MAN          
            WHO NEARLY DESTROYED
            OUR HOUSE AND NAME. 

653
00:38:28.406 --> 00:38:30.240
                 I'M COLD.      

654
00:38:30.274 --> 00:38:32.976
I'LL FETCH MORE WOOD            
FOR THE FIRE. MY LORD.          

655
00:38:33.010 --> 00:38:35.362
                    MMM.        

656
00:38:37.948 --> 00:38:40.200
      ( horse whinnies )        

657
00:38:59.169 --> 00:39:01.805
            ( grunts )          

658
00:39:01.839 --> 00:39:03.506
WHERE ARE YOU GOING. GIRL?      

659
00:39:03.524 --> 00:39:06.476
             THE ARMORY.        
             MY LORD.           

660
00:39:06.510 --> 00:39:08.111
        WHY?                    

661
00:39:08.145 --> 00:39:09.979
          LORD TYWIN SENT ME.   

662
00:39:11.949 --> 00:39:14.200
WHAT MIGHT THIS BE?             

663
00:39:14.235 --> 00:39:17.153
      LORD TYWIN GAVE IT TO ME. 

664
00:39:17.187 --> 00:39:19.239
     WHAT FOR?                  

665
00:39:19.290 --> 00:39:22.125
        TO TAKE TO THE ARMORY.  

666
00:39:22.159 --> 00:39:24.661
 WHY WOULD HE DO THAT?          

667
00:39:26.614 --> 00:39:28.248
 LET'S GO AND ASK HIM.          

668
00:39:30.868 --> 00:39:33.169
                MOVE!           

669
00:39:34.672 --> 00:39:37.140
     GET OUT OF THE WAY!        

670
00:39:50.321 --> 00:39:53.573
    ( men chatting )            

671
00:40:06.787 --> 00:40:08.738
      AMORY LORCH.              

672
00:40:08.756 --> 00:40:10.757
             A GIRL HAS NAMED   
             A SECOND NAME.     

673
00:40:10.791 --> 00:40:12.375
            A MAN WILL DO       
            WHAT MUST BE DONE.  

674
00:40:12.409 --> 00:40:14.344
        NOW!                    

675
00:40:14.378 --> 00:40:18.247
        A GIRL CANNOT TELL      
        A MAN WHEN EXACTLY      
        HE MUST DO A THING.     

676
00:40:18.265 --> 00:40:20.550
        A MAN CANNOT            
        MAKE A THING HAPPEN     
        BEFORE ITS TIME.        

677
00:40:20.584 --> 00:40:22.519
BUT HE'S GOING TO TELL TYWIN.   
HE'S GETTING AWAY.              

678
00:40:22.553 --> 00:40:25.555
      - IT HAS TO BE NOW.       
      - ( sighs )               

679
00:40:32.730 --> 00:40:34.814
            GUARD!              

680
00:40:39.036 --> 00:40:41.488
       <i>( horse whinnies )</i>       

681
00:40:44.107 --> 00:40:46.442
         - YOUR GRACE.          
         - YOUR GRACE.          

682
00:40:50.297 --> 00:40:52.832
  MY HONOR. YOUR GRACE.         

683
00:40:52.883 --> 00:40:55.301
YOUR GRACE.                     

684
00:41:00.391 --> 00:41:02.926
         - YOUR GRACE.          
         - QUENT.               

685
00:41:23.864 --> 00:41:25.748
    LADY TALISA.                

686
00:41:26.750 --> 00:41:28.334
                YOUR GRACE.     

687
00:41:30.120 --> 00:41:31.921
    I'M NOT SURE I'M A LADY.    

688
00:41:31.956 --> 00:41:34.090
     WESTEROSI CUSTOMS ARE STILL
     A BIT FOREIGN TO ME.       

689
00:41:34.124 --> 00:41:36.509
IT'S HARD TO KEEP               
ALL THE RULES STRAIGHT.         

690
00:41:36.544 --> 00:41:39.662
BUT IF I REMEMBER               
MY LESSONS.                     

691
00:41:39.680 --> 00:41:42.215
A WOMAN OF NOBLE BIRTH          
IS ALWAYS CALLED A LADY         

692
00:41:42.266 --> 00:41:44.767
UNLESS SHE'S A QUEEN            
OR A PRINCESS.                  

693
00:41:44.802 --> 00:41:47.003
I COULD FIND                    
SOMEONE WHO KNOWS.              

694
00:41:47.021 --> 00:41:49.606
        WHY ARE YOU SO SURE     
        I'M OF NOBLE BIRTH?     

695
00:41:49.640 --> 00:41:51.674
 BECAUSE IT'S OBVIOUS.          

696
00:41:51.709 --> 00:41:55.344
WHAT IF I TOLD YOU MY FATHER    
SOLD LACE ON THE LONG BRIDGE    

697
00:41:55.362 --> 00:41:58.314
      AND MY MOTHER.            
      MY BROTHER. AND I LIVED   
      WITH HIM ABOVE OUR SHOP?  

698
00:41:59.817 --> 00:42:01.183
I'D CALL YOU A LIAR.            

699
00:42:01.202 --> 00:42:04.621
    NOT VERY NOBLE TO ACCUSE    
    A LADY OF DISHONESTY.       

700
00:42:08.876 --> 00:42:10.743
        I ALWAYS THOUGHT        
        I WAS A BRILLIANT LIAR. 

701
00:42:11.862 --> 00:42:14.130
 BETTER AT AMPUTATIONS.         
 I'M AFRAID.                    

702
00:42:19.253 --> 00:42:20.837
 QUITE A PRETTY SPOT.           

703
00:42:20.871 --> 00:42:23.506
          WILL WE BE HERE LONG? 

704
00:42:23.540 --> 00:42:26.259
I COULDN'T REALLY DISCUSS       
TROOP MOVEMENTS WITH YOU.       

705
00:42:26.310 --> 00:42:28.728
              I'M NOT A SPY.    

706
00:42:28.762 --> 00:42:31.848
 OF COURSE A SPY                
 WOULD DENY BEING A SPY.        

707
00:42:33.150 --> 00:42:35.685
          YOU'RE RIGHT.         
          YOU'VE FOUND ME OUT.  

708
00:42:35.719 --> 00:42:37.437
          I'M WRITING A LETTER  
          TO THE LANNISTERS.    

709
00:42:37.488 --> 00:42:39.906
             "THE YOUNG WOLF    
             IS ON THE MOVE."   

710
00:42:41.825 --> 00:42:43.660
  PERHAPS YOU'D JOIN ME...      

711
00:42:45.162 --> 00:42:47.947
IF YOU'VE GOT TIME.             
OF COURSE. FOR. WELL...         

712
00:42:47.998 --> 00:42:50.283
        ROBB.                   

713
00:42:51.452 --> 00:42:53.586
        MOTHER.                 

714
00:42:59.376 --> 00:43:02.244
    MOTHER. THIS IS             
    LADY TALISA.                

715
00:43:02.263 --> 00:43:04.547
          SHE'S BEEN HELPING    
          WITH THE WOUNDED.     

716
00:43:04.581 --> 00:43:07.467
          SHE'S BEEN VERY...    
          HELPFUL.              

717
00:43:07.518 --> 00:43:09.052
LADY TALISA.                    

718
00:43:09.086 --> 00:43:10.753
              LADY STARK.       

719
00:43:10.771 --> 00:43:12.605
    LADY TALISA...?             

720
00:43:12.640 --> 00:43:16.225
        - MAEGYR.               
        - MAEGYR?               

721
00:43:16.259 --> 00:43:19.195
 FORGIVE ME.                    
 I DO NOT KNOW THIS NAME.       

722
00:43:19.229 --> 00:43:22.282
        AN UNCOMMON NAME HERE.  
        AN OLD NAME IN VOLANTIS.

723
00:43:23.367 --> 00:43:26.486
            EXCUSE ME. MY LADY. 
            YOUR GRACE.         

724
00:43:35.079 --> 00:43:36.746
    I'VE MISSED YOU.            

725
00:43:36.780 --> 00:43:40.166
             YES. YOU LOOK      
             POSITIVELY FORLORN.

726
00:43:40.217 --> 00:43:43.052
YOU SURPRISED ME.               
THAT'S ALL.                     

727
00:43:43.087 --> 00:43:46.255
I DIDN'T THINK                  
I'D SEE YOU TODAY.              

728
00:43:46.289 --> 00:43:48.641
    I WISH THAT YOU WERE FREE   
    TO FOLLOW YOUR HEART.       

729
00:43:48.676 --> 00:43:50.109
     I KNOW.                    

730
00:43:50.144 --> 00:43:52.812
      YOU HAVE INHERITED YOUR   
      FATHER'S RESPONSIBILITIES.

731
00:43:52.846 --> 00:43:55.648
          I'M AFRAID THEY COME  
          AT A COST.            

732
00:43:55.683 --> 00:43:59.102
    - I KNOW.                   
    - YOU ARE PROMISED          
      TO ANOTHER--              

733
00:43:59.987 --> 00:44:03.606
      A DEBT THAT MUST BE PAID. 

734
00:44:03.640 --> 00:44:05.992
     - I HAVEN'T FORGOTTEN.     
     - YOUR GRACE.              

735
00:44:06.026 --> 00:44:09.779
        MY LADY.                
     NEWS FROM WINTERFELL.      

736
00:44:09.813 --> 00:44:11.748
    ( wind howling )            

737
00:44:22.159 --> 00:44:24.961
      YOUR BROTHERS DESERT YOU? 

738
00:44:24.995 --> 00:44:27.213
            I CAN TELL YOU      
            WHICH WAY TO GO.    

739
00:44:27.247 --> 00:44:29.882
    WE'LL STOP HERE.            

740
00:44:29.933 --> 00:44:31.884
        TOO DARK TO GO          
      ANY FARTHER TODAY.        

741
00:44:31.935 --> 00:44:34.837
            HERE? THERE'S NO    
            SHELTER HERE.       

742
00:44:34.855 --> 00:44:36.272
THERE'S NO SHELTER              
ANYWHERE.                       

743
00:44:36.306 --> 00:44:39.025
         THERE IS IF YOU KNOW   
         WHERE TO LOOK.         

744
00:44:42.479 --> 00:44:44.447
          THE COLD              
          COULD KILL US BOTH.   

745
00:44:44.481 --> 00:44:46.482
    - IF YOU LIGHT A FIRE--     
    - NO FIRE.                  

746
00:44:46.516 --> 00:44:49.318
    - BUT A FIRE IS--           
    - NO FIRE.                  

747
00:44:51.955 --> 00:44:54.073
              HAVE IT YOUR WAY. 

748
00:45:01.031 --> 00:45:03.633
WE'LL STAY WARMER               
IF WE STAY CLOSE.               

749
00:45:05.602 --> 00:45:08.171
BET YOU FREEZE TO DEATH         
BEFORE I DO.                    

750
00:45:10.007 --> 00:45:12.425
BET YOUR LIFE.                  

751
00:45:36.900 --> 00:45:39.035
              THINK THEY'RE OUT 
              LOOKING FOR YOU?  

752
00:45:40.437 --> 00:45:43.189
- YES.                          
- THINK THEY'LL FIND YOU?       

753
00:45:43.223 --> 00:45:45.425
                 YES.           

754
00:45:48.128 --> 00:45:50.179
         YOU'RE BRAVE.          

755
00:45:51.215 --> 00:45:53.049
        STUPID.                 

756
00:45:53.083 --> 00:45:54.984
          BUT BRAVE.            

757
00:45:57.621 --> 00:46:00.890
        WE START AGAIN          
        AT FIRST LIGHT.         
        GET SOME SLEEP.         

758
00:46:16.940 --> 00:46:18.708
      STOP MOVING.              

759
00:46:18.742 --> 00:46:22.411
             I'M JUST TRYING    
             TO GET COMFORTABLE.

760
00:46:22.445 --> 00:46:24.297
        STOP IT!                

761
00:46:36.677 --> 00:46:39.228
    - <i>YOU'RE STILL MOVING.</i>      
    - WAS I?                    

762
00:46:39.263 --> 00:46:41.814
        I DIDN'T NOTICE         
        THAT TIME.              

763
00:46:52.943 --> 00:46:54.660
        THIS CANNOT BE TRUE.    

764
00:46:54.695 --> 00:46:56.412
 Bolton:                        
 <i>WE'VE HAD RAVENS</i>               
 <i>FROM WHITE HARBOR.</i>             

765
00:46:56.446 --> 00:46:58.647
BARROWTON                       
AND THE DREADFORT.              

766
00:46:58.665 --> 00:47:00.666
I'M AFRAID IT IS TRUE.          

767
00:47:01.585 --> 00:47:03.485
            WHY?                
            WHY WOULD THEON--   

768
00:47:03.504 --> 00:47:05.755
BECAUSE THE GREYJOYS            
ARE TREASONOUS WHORES.          

769
00:47:05.789 --> 00:47:08.457
 - <i>MY BROTHERS?</i>                 
 - WE'VE HEARD NOTHING OF THEM. 

770
00:47:08.491 --> 00:47:10.376
        ( sighs )               

771
00:47:10.427 --> 00:47:12.712
 BUT RODRIK CASSEL IS DEAD.     

772
00:47:15.132 --> 00:47:17.433
          I TOLD YOU.           
    NEVER TRUST A GREYJOY!      

773
00:47:20.437 --> 00:47:22.555
    I MUST GO NORTH AT ONCE.    

774
00:47:22.606 --> 00:47:24.724
THERE'S STILL A WAR             
TO WIN. YOUR GRACE.             

775
00:47:24.775 --> 00:47:27.226
HOW CAN I CALL MYSELF KING      
IF I CAN'T HOLD MY OWN CASTLE?  

776
00:47:27.277 --> 00:47:30.479
  - HOW CAN I ASK MEN           
    TO FOLLOW ME IF I CAN'T--   
  - YOU ARE A KING.             

777
00:47:30.513 --> 00:47:33.349
AND THAT MEANS YOU DON'T HAVE   
TO DO EVERYTHING YOURSELF.      

778
00:47:33.367 --> 00:47:35.184
        LET ME GO               
      AND TALK TO THEON.        

779
00:47:35.202 --> 00:47:38.120
THERE WILL BE NO TALK.          
HE WILL DIE FOR THIS.           

780
00:47:38.155 --> 00:47:41.407
  THEON HOLDS THE CASTLE        
  WITH A SKELETON CREW.         

781
00:47:41.458 --> 00:47:43.793
    LET ME SEND WORD TO         
    MY BASTARD AT THE DREADFORT.

782
00:47:43.827 --> 00:47:48.030
      HE CAN RAISE A FEW HUNDRED
      MEN AND RETAKE WINTERFELL 
      BEFORE THE NEW MOON.      

783
00:47:48.048 --> 00:47:51.150
        WE HAVE THE LANNISTERS  
        ON THE RUN.             

784
00:47:51.184 --> 00:47:55.838
        IF YOU MARCH ALL THE WAY
        BACK NORTH NOW. YOU'LL  
        LOSE WHAT YOU GAINED.   

785
00:47:55.872 --> 00:47:59.508
          MY BOY WOULD BE       
          HONORED TO BRING YOU  
          PRINCE THEON'S HEAD.  

786
00:47:59.543 --> 00:48:04.146
 TELL YOUR SON                  
 BRAN AND RICKON'S              
 SAFETY IS PARAMOUNT.           

787
00:48:04.181 --> 00:48:07.183
    AND THEON-- I WANT HIM      
    BROUGHT TO ME ALIVE.        

788
00:48:08.718 --> 00:48:11.187
I WANT TO LOOK HIM              
IN THE EYE AND ASK HIM WHY.     

789
00:48:11.221 --> 00:48:13.823
AND THEN I'LL TAKE              
HIS HEAD MYSELF.                

790
00:48:13.857 --> 00:48:17.726
      WHY ON EARTH WOULD I TRUST
      THE WORD OF A LYING LITTLE
      SAVAGE LIKE YOU?          

791
00:48:17.744 --> 00:48:19.662
     I'M NO LIAR.               

792
00:48:20.781 --> 00:48:22.731
         ALL WILDLINGS          
         ARE LIARS AND SAVAGES  

793
00:48:22.749 --> 00:48:24.584
         WITH NO LOYALTY        
         TO ANYTHING OR ANYONE. 

794
00:48:24.618 --> 00:48:26.953
  I DONE WHAT I HAD             
  TO DO TO STAY ALIVE.          

795
00:48:27.004 --> 00:48:29.872
I HATE THE STARKS               
AS WELL AS YOU DO.              

796
00:48:29.906 --> 00:48:33.209
  LET ME SERVE YOU.             
  MY LORD.                      

797
00:48:33.243 --> 00:48:36.045
    HOW? AND DON'T TELL ME      
    TO PUT A SPEAR IN YOUR HAND.

798
00:48:36.079 --> 00:48:38.547
THERE ARE OTHER WAYS            
TO SERVE. MY LORD.              

799
00:48:38.581 --> 00:48:41.100
             I'M A PRINCE NOW.  
             AND YOU'D DO WELL--

800
00:48:41.134 --> 00:48:44.053
THERE ARE OTHER WAYS            
TO SERVE. MY PRINCE.            

801
00:48:44.087 --> 00:48:46.588
         ( chuckles )           

802
00:48:48.525 --> 00:48:50.142
                 LIKE WHAT?     

803
00:48:52.696 --> 00:48:55.481
        WE KNOW THINGS.         
    THE FREE PEOPLE.            

804
00:48:55.532 --> 00:48:58.100
            YOU KNOW THINGS?    

805
00:48:58.118 --> 00:49:00.036
              LIKE WHAT?        

806
00:49:00.070 --> 00:49:02.321
             HOW TO EAT DIRT?   
             ( laughs )         

807
00:49:02.372 --> 00:49:05.374
         ( scoffs )             
         OTHER THINGS.          

808
00:49:06.543 --> 00:49:09.128
        SAVAGE THINGS.          

809
00:49:11.131 --> 00:49:12.965
            WAIT OUTSIDE.       

810
00:49:29.900 --> 00:49:32.101
    I ALWAYS WONDERED           
    WHAT YOU HAD UNDER THERE.   

811
00:49:32.135 --> 00:49:35.137
 IT COMES AT A PRICE.           

812
00:49:35.155 --> 00:49:37.440
        I'M NOT KILLING YOU.    
        THAT'S YOUR PRICE.      

813
00:49:37.474 --> 00:49:39.025
I ALREADY HAD THAT.             

814
00:49:40.577 --> 00:49:42.028
        WHAT DO YOU WANT. THEN. 

815
00:49:42.079 --> 00:49:44.664
         OTHER THAN             
         YOUR MISERABLE LIFE?   

816
00:49:44.698 --> 00:49:46.815
WHAT ALL FREE PEOPLE WANT--     

817
00:49:46.833 --> 00:49:48.984
     MY FREEDOM.                

818
00:49:53.840 --> 00:49:55.708
            WELL. YOU SHALL     
            HAVE IT. THEN.      

819
00:49:57.994 --> 00:50:00.546
            BUT ONLY IF YOU     
            SERVE ME WELL.      

820
00:50:06.520 --> 00:50:08.387
             - OW.              
            - SHH.              

821
00:50:08.438 --> 00:50:11.507
     - IT'S NOT DEEP.           
     - I THOUGHT THEY WERE      
       GOING TO KILL ME.        

822
00:50:11.525 --> 00:50:13.059
THEY THOUGHT SO. TOO.           

823
00:50:13.110 --> 00:50:15.728
         HE HATED ME.           
      THE MAN WHO HIT ME.       

824
00:50:15.779 --> 00:50:18.347
     I SAW IT IN HIS EYES.      
        HATED ME.               

825
00:50:18.365 --> 00:50:20.182
    HE NEVER MET ME BEFORE.     

826
00:50:20.200 --> 00:50:23.185
         BUT HE WANTED          
          TO HURT ME.           

827
00:50:23.203 --> 00:50:26.238
 - OF COURSE HE DID.            
 - WHY? WHY WOULD A STRANGER--  

828
00:50:26.289 --> 00:50:28.541
YOU ARE EVERYTHING              
HE WILL NEVER HAVE.             

829
00:50:28.575 --> 00:50:30.710
YOUR HORSE EATS BETTER          
THAN HIS CHILDREN.              

830
00:50:30.744 --> 00:50:34.080
IT DOESN'T MATTER NOW.          
HE'S DEAD.                      

831
00:50:34.131 --> 00:50:36.999
I WOULD HAVE GIVEN THEM         
BREAD IF I HAD IT.              

832
00:50:37.033 --> 00:50:39.635
I HATE THE KING                 
MORE THAN ANY OF THEM.          

833
00:50:39.669 --> 00:50:41.504
DON'T SAY THESE THINGS.         

834
00:50:41.538 --> 00:50:42.805
 IF THE WRONG                   
 PEOPLE HEAR YOU--              

835
00:50:42.839 --> 00:50:45.141
            BUT YOU'RE NOT      
            THE WRONG PEOPLE.   

836
00:50:50.547 --> 00:50:52.714
        DON'T TRUST ANYBODY.    

837
00:50:52.733 --> 00:50:55.317
            LIFE IS SAFER       
            THAT WAY.           

838
00:51:23.713 --> 00:51:26.882
     ( murmurs )                

839
00:51:36.143 --> 00:51:38.978
                AND WHERE       
                ARE YOU GOING?  

840
00:51:40.230 --> 00:51:42.782
I HAVE SOMETHING FOR YOU        
FROM PRINCE THEON.              

841
00:51:42.816 --> 00:51:45.651
            - WHAT?             
            - ME.               

842
00:51:48.071 --> 00:51:50.873
    HE SAYS I'M TO MAKE         
    THE ROUNDS.                 

843
00:51:56.997 --> 00:51:59.498
    AND KEEP YOU WARM.          

844
00:52:04.454 --> 00:52:07.056
                 ( groans )     

845
00:52:09.926 --> 00:52:12.561
         ( whistles )           

846
00:52:21.688 --> 00:52:24.156
          ( panting )           

847
00:52:26.526 --> 00:52:29.862
THE SPICE KING REFUSES ME       
BECAUSE I'M A BAD INVESTMENT.   

848
00:52:29.913 --> 00:52:33.532
  THE SILK KING WON'T SUPPORT ME
  BECAUSE OF HIS BUSINESS WITH  
  THE LANNISTERS.               

849
00:52:33.583 --> 00:52:35.534
            WHY OFFEND          
            HIS BEST CUSTOMER?  

850
00:52:35.585 --> 00:52:38.954
    AND THE COPPER KING         
    OFFERS ME A SINGLE SHIP     

851
00:52:38.988 --> 00:52:42.341
     ON THE CONDITION THAT I LIE
     WITH HIM FOR A NIGHT.      

852
00:52:42.375 --> 00:52:45.344
    DOES HE THINK I WILL        
    WHORE MYSELF FOR A BOAT?    

853
00:52:45.378 --> 00:52:48.881
WHEN I CAME TO THIS CITY.       
I HAD NOTHING.                  

854
00:52:48.932 --> 00:52:51.417
TRULY NOTHING.                  

855
00:52:51.451 --> 00:52:53.519
I SLEPT BY THE DOCKS.           

856
00:52:53.553 --> 00:52:56.305
AND WHEN I COULD FIND           
WORK LOADING THE SHIPS.         
I WOULD EAT.                    

857
00:52:56.339 --> 00:52:59.358
IF NOT.                         
I DREAMED OF FOOD.              

858
00:52:59.392 --> 00:53:02.394
TODAY I AM THE RICHEST          
MAN IN QARTH.                   

859
00:53:02.445 --> 00:53:04.864
DO YOU THINK THE PATH           
FROM POVERTY TO WEALTH          

860
00:53:04.898 --> 00:53:07.283
 IS ALWAYS PURE                 
 AND HONORABLE?                 

861
00:53:07.317 --> 00:53:10.953
I HAVE DONE                     
MANY THINGS. KHALEESI.          

862
00:53:10.987 --> 00:53:13.489
THAT A RIGHTEOUS MAN            
WOULD CONDEMN.                  

863
00:53:13.523 --> 00:53:17.076
AND HERE I AM.                  
WITH NO REGRETS.                

864
00:53:29.923 --> 00:53:33.559
              BAR THE GATES.    
              RING THE BELLS.   

865
00:53:33.593 --> 00:53:36.262
    SLOWLY. KHALEESI.           

866
00:53:36.313 --> 00:53:38.430
     - <i>( bells tolling )</i>        
     - <i>( people shouting )</i>      

867
00:53:45.722 --> 00:53:47.990
 <i>WHERE ARE THEY?</i>                

868
00:53:54.397 --> 00:53:57.082
    WHERE ARE MY DRAGONS?!      

869
00:54:02.739 --> 00:54:05.457
     <i>( dragons screeching )</i>     

870
00:54:25.095 --> 00:54:27.863
 <i>( theme music playing )</i>
